config BR2_PACKAGE_PORTSMOKE
    bool "Legacy PortSmoke compatibility helper"
    select BR2_PACKAGE_UTIL_LINUX
    select BR2_PACKAGE_UTIL_LINUX_MOUNT
    select BR2_PACKAGE_UTIL_LINUX_UMOUNT
    help
      Optional legacy helper only. New applications use .lilpck packages
      and /storage/independent-apps, not modular engine images. It launches
      CPU-only, software-rendered SDL2/DirectFB engines packaged as
      SquashFS .peng images on /storage/portsmoke.

      PortSmoke does not provide an external input mapper. Engines are
      expected to be patched or configured at build time for the target
      handheld controls.
